  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Every Eldritch Cannon you create is now more destructive.</p><p><strong>Detonate.</strong> When your cannon takes damage, you can take a Reaction to make it detonate if you are within 60 feet of it. This destroys the cannon and forces each creature within 20 feet of it to make a Dexterity saving throw against your spell save DC, taking 3d10 Force damage on a failure or half as much on a success.</p><p><strong>Firepower.</strong> The damage rolls of your cannon and the Temporary Hit Points of its Protector option increase by 1d8.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
